[00:00.000] 作词 : Jonathan Coulton (胜利已然在望。)
[00:00.000] 作曲 : Jonathan Coulton
[00:00.000] 编曲 : Jonathan Coulton
[00:00.000]This was a triumph.
[00:04.030]I'm making a note here: (我要记下这一笔：)
[00:06.350]HUGE SUCCESS. (巨大的成功！)
[00:08.950]It's hard to overstate my satisfaction. (我此刻的喜悦之情莫可名状。)
[00:16.180]Aperture Science (光圈科技)
[00:19.900]We do what we must because we can. (我们为所必为，因为我们无所不能。)
[00:25.170]For the good of all of us. (为了我们所有人的利益。)
[00:28.530]Except the ones who are dead. (当然不包括那些死掉的家伙。)
[00:30.710]But there's no sense crying over every mistake. (不必为过去每一次失败而沮丧。)
[00:34.640]You just keep on trying till you run out of cake. (只要你坚持尝试，直到用完了奖励的蛋糕。)
[00:38.660]And the Science gets done. (而科研自然已经接近完成。)
[00:40.670]And you make a neat gun. (而你拥有时空操纵之枪。)
[00:42.640]For the people who are still alive. (为了所有活着的人啊。)
[00:52.020]I'm not even angry. (让憎恨随风。)
[00:56.190]I'm being so sincere right now. (我心境明澄。)
[01:01.150]Even though you broke my heart. (即使揉碎我的心。)
[01:04.820]And killed me. (让我不得生。)
[01:08.230]And tore me to pieces. (将我碾为灰尘。)
[01:11.870]And threw every piece into a fire. (抑或将我推入火炕。)
[01:17.150]As they burned it hurt because I was so happy for you! (我燃烧之时，略为伤神，因为我曾是为你喝彩的人。)
[01:22.700]Now these points of data make a beautiful line. (现在数据点已经绘出美丽的曲线。)
[01:26.710]And we're out of beta. (我们即将完成最后测试。)
[01:28.700]We're releasing on time. (还能赶上按时发布。)
[01:30.680]So I'm glad and I got burned. (我是如此幸福，即使我被烈火焚身。)
[01:32.700]Think of all the things we learned for the people who are still alive. (我已经有所心得，在那些幸存的家伙身上。)
[01:44.290]Go ahead and leave me. (走你的路莫回头。)
[01:48.110]I think I prefer to stay in side. (我愿意一直在你的身后。)
[01:53.100]Maybe you'll find someone else to help you. (可能有一天你会找到帮助你的新朋友。)
[02:00.150]Maybe Black Mesa (是黑山的战友？)
[02:04.120]THAT WAS A JOKE. (别做梦啦。)
[02:05.710]HAHA, FAT CHANCE. (哈哈，机会没有。)
[02:09.150]Anyway, this cake is great. (无论如何，蛋糕是最棒的。)
[02:12.340]It's so delicious and moist. (它是如此美味而爽口。)
[02:14.750]Look at me still talking when there's Science to do. (就像我一边聊天，一边还可以做研究。)
[02:18.670]When I look out there, it makes me GLaD I'm not you. (眺望前路，我窃喜于不必面对你那些艰难险阻。)
[02:22.670]I've experiments to run. (我还有实验要做。)
[02:24.710]There is research to be done. (我还有报告要补。)
[02:26.710]On the people who are still alive. (在那些幸存者身上。)
[02:30.650]And believe me I am still alive. (相信我，我还活着。)
[02:34.630]I'm doing Science and I'm still alive. (我正在做研究，所以我还活着。)
[02:38.470]I feel FANTASTIC and I'm still alive. (我异想天开，所以我要活着。)
[02:42.620]While you're dying I'll be still alive. (你垂死之刻，我仍会活着。)
[02:46.450]And when you're dead I will be still alive. (你作古之时，我还会活着。)
[02:50.340]STILL ALIVE (仍然活着！)
[02:52.320]STILL ALIVE (仍然活着！)
